  "title": "US military execution of Nidal Hasan livestreamed, condemned by Catholic leaders",
  "summary": "The US military will livestream the execution of Nidal Hasan, a former army psychiatrist who killed 13 people at Fort Hood, marking the first U.S. military execution in over 60 years. A defense department official confirmed the execution will be public, with the firing squad carrying out the sentence at Fort Hood, Texas, on 3 December.",
